{"candidateAnswer":"Several countries across different continents","evidence":"[D6:12 | 9:32 pm on 20 April, 2022] James: I agree with you, I also love to travel. Last year I visited Italy, for example. A very beautiful country with delicious food.\n[D6:14 | 9:32 pm on 20 April, 2022] James: In fact, I haven't visited many countries. Besides Italy, I was also in Turkey and Mexico. What was the last country you visited?\n[D16:9 | 5:13 pm on 9 July, 2022] James: I also love to read, especially while snuggled under the covers on a cold winter day. But now it’s summer and I want something more exciting! By the way, I bought air tickets to Toronto, and I’m leaving the day after tomorrow evening.\n[D17:22 | 9:49 am on 22 July, 2022] James: Everything went great! In addition, I even managed to get out to another country. The city of Nuuk, if you know. I stayed there quite a bit, but at least I had one more country to add to my bucket list!","itemId":"urn:uuid:957064d9-a7ff-5ffc-a10d-9f1108bd8ecc","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ea9aa22c9af6007f9538e8f7a0783e6910526dcf058bae89a028f5545334225f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which countries has James visited?","referenceAnswer":"Italy, Mexico, Turkey, Canada, Greenland","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ea9aa22c9af6007f9538e8f7a0783e6910526dcf058bae89a028f5545334225f"}}]}